    "content": "Here's what I found after mapping your calendar through the end of 2026.\n\n## Your existing commitments (key blockers)\n\n| Date | Event |\n|------|-------|\n| Jul 18 (Sat) | Church, pick up feebee, dinner — *very packed day* |\n| Jul 19 (Sun) | Jarod's confirmation, study with feebee, stay over Zac's |\n| Jul 20 (Mon) | Round 1 coursereg + WC finals 3am |\n| Jul 22 (Wed) | Run & dinner with Ethan |\n| Jul 23 (Thu) | Huixin farewell dinner |\n| Jul 25 (Sat) | Car picnic with feebee + AG (4pm) |\n| Jul 27 (Mon) | Redeem Starbucks stars |\n| Jul 28 (Tue) | Round 2 coursereg |\n| Jul 30 (Thu) | Let prof know about IT1244 TA |\n| Aug 1 (Sat) | Talk with feebee + AG (4pm) |\n| Aug 3 (Mon) | Round 3 coursereg |\n| Aug 5 (Wed) | Spiderman with feebee |\n| Aug 11 (Tue) | Round 1 tutorial reg |\n| **Every Sat** | **AG at 4pm (recurring)** |\n| Sep 4–6 (Fri–Sun) | **AG Retreat (3 full days)** |\n| Oct 3 (Sat) | Undo Apple TV subscription |\n| Nov 1 (Sun) | Nic Yap birthday |\n| Dec 20 (Sun) | Feebee birthday |\n\n---\n\n## Best window: **August 15–30 — 16 days overseas**\n\nWith 10 leave days perfectly spanning two full work weeks, you get 3 weekends for free:\n\n| | Days | Type |\n|---|------|------|\n| Aug 15–16 | Sat–Sun | Weekend (free) |\n| Aug 17–21 | Mon–Fri | **Leave (5 days)** |\n| Aug 22–23 | Sat–Sun | Weekend (free) |\n| Aug 24–28 | Mon–Fri | **Leave (5 days)** |\n| Aug 29–30 | Sat–Sun | Weekend (free) |\n\n**Total: 16 calendar days for 10 leave days.**\n\n⚠️ **The one catch:** your recurring **\"AG\" at 4pm every Saturday** falls on Aug 15, 22, and 29 — all three Saturdays of this trip. You'd miss those three sessions. There's no window that avoids this since AG runs every Saturday indefinitely.\n\nThe only other clean long window is after the Sep 4–6 AG Retreat, but that pushes you to mid-September and the same Saturday-AG issue remains.\n\n---\n\nIf this window works for you, I can block the leave days in your calendar. Would you like me to go ahead?",
